00:02:08.717 --> 00:02:12.896
THE PARADE OF ABSURDITIES CAN

00:02:12.897 --> 00:02:15.072
HARDLY BE TAKEN SERIOUSLY.

00:02:15.073 --> 00:02:16.938
BRET, I THINK THE PRESIDENT AND

00:02:16.940 --> 00:02:18.449
