00:02:24.855 --> 00:02:27.592
OUR REDLINE IS GOING TO BE

00:02:27.626 --> 00:02:28.690
LIABILITY PROTECTIONS FOR THOSE

00:02:28.725 --> 00:02:32.255
WHO ARE BRAVE ENOUGH TO BEGIN TO

00:02:32.257 --> 00:02:34.543
