00:02:57.017 --> 00:02:58.694
IF WE ARE REALLY GOING TO GET

00:02:58.696 --> 00:03:00.540
THE ECONOMY UP AND GOING, PEOPLE

00:03:00.541 --> 00:03:03.045
HAVE TO BE BRAVE ENOUGH TO BEGIN

00:03:03.079 --> 00:03:04.592
TO ENGAGE IN ECONOMIC ACTIVITY.

