STUDENTS BUT POTENTIALLY COLLEGE

00:03:16.264 --> 00:03:18.420
STUDENTS ARE STILL AT HOME?

00:03:18.455 --> 00:03:20.257
ALL THOSE QUESTIONS NEED TO BE

00:03:20.291 --> 00:03:21.933
