00:03:21.934 --> 00:03:24.459
LIABILITY PROTECTION WILL HELP

00:03:24.494 --> 00:03:25.774
PROVIDE THE ANSWER.

00:03:25.775 --> 00:03:27.103
&gt;&gt; Bret: WHAT TRIGGERS THAT

00:03:27.137 --> 00:03:27.692
NEGOTIATION START?

00:03:27.694 --> 00:03:29.368
THE PPP, THE NEXT TRANCHE IS

00:03:29.402 --> 00:03:32.037
GOING TO BE UP AT SOME POINT.

