WE WILL LET YOU KNOW WHEN WE

00:03:40.388 --> 00:03:42.999
THINK THE TIME IS RIGHT TO BEGIN

00:03:43.033 --> 00:03:43.759
TO MOVE AGAIN.

00:03:43.793 --> 00:03:45.516
I THINK THERE’S A HIGH

00:03:45.517 --> 00:03:46.769
LIKELIHOOD WE WILL DO ANOTHER

00:03:46.770 --> 00:03:47.859
BILL, AND I’VE JUST INDICATED

00:03:47.893 --> 00:03:51.090
