00:04:10.606 --> 00:04:12.113
AND TO THE PRESIDENT RECENTLY

00:04:12.147 --> 00:04:13.731
ABOUT THIS.

00:04:13.765 --> 00:04:16.561
I THINK WE ALL BELIEVE THAT

00:04:16.562 --> 00:04:18.535
ANOTHER BILL PROBABLY IS GOING

00:04:18.536 --> 00:04:19.983
TO BE NECESSARY.

00:04:19.984 --> 00:04:21.445
BUT I’M NOT PREPARED TODAY TO

00:04:21.446 --> 00:04:23.534
