00:04:24.546 --> 00:04:27.477
WHAT I CAN TELL YOU, AS I TOLD

00:04:27.511 --> 00:04:29.378
YOU EARLIER, IT’S GOING TO

00:04:29.413 --> 00:04:30.347
INCLUDE LIABILITY PROTECTIONS IN

00:04:30.381 --> 00:04:31.897
ORDER TO GET THROUGH THE SENATE

00:04:31.898 --> 00:04:33.632
AND IN ORDER TO BE SIGNED BY THE

00:04:33.667 --> 00:04:34.076
PRESIDENT.

00:04:34.111 --> 00:04:36.112
WE WILL LOOK AT WHAT THE

00:04:36.113 --> 00:04:37.508
CONDITIONS ARE IN THE NEAR

00:04:37.510 --> 00:04:38.953
FUTURE AND DECIDE HOW THAT OUGHT

00:04:38.955 --> 00:04:40.402
TO BE CRAFTED.

00:04:40.403 --> 00:04:45.075
IT’S NOT GOING TO BE A

00:04:45.076 --> 00:04:47.041
$3 TRILLION LEFT-WING WISH LIST

00:04:47.042 --> 00:04:49.450
LIKE THE SPEAKER IS APPARENTLY

00:04:49.484 --> 00:04:51.351
GOING TO TRY TO JAM DOWN THE

00:04:51.385 --> 00:04:52.703
