00:04:57.848 --> 00:04:59.528
&gt;&gt; I WANT THEM TO FEEL

00:04:59.530 --> 00:05:01.335
COMFORTABLE TO BE ABLE TO OPEN

00:05:01.336 --> 00:05:02.884
UP THIS FALL AND I THINK

00:05:02.886 --> 00:05:04.157
ANSWERING THIS LIABILITY

00:05:04.158 --> 00:05:06.050
QUESTION IS A BIG PART OF IT.

00:05:06.085 --> 00:05:07.980
THE COUNTRY IS A YEARNING TO

00:05:08.014 --> 00:05:10.182
BEGIN TO GET BACK TO NORMAL.

00:05:10.183 --> 00:05:11.511
WE WANT TO DO IT CONSISTENT WITH

00:05:11.512 --> 00:05:14.457
