00:05:14.458 --> 00:05:16.325
CORONAVIRUS TASK FORCE THAT THE

00:05:16.360 --> 00:05:17.233
ADMINISTRATION SET UP, THE

00:05:17.234 --> 00:05:18.087
WHITE HOUSE TASK FORCE.

00:05:18.122 --> 00:05:20.402
MORE AND MORE PEOPLE BELIEVE

00:05:20.436 --> 00:05:22.670
THAT WE CAN BEGIN TO SAFELY

00:05:22.704 --> 00:05:23.808
ENGAGE AGAIN, PRACTICING SOCIAL

00:05:23.809 --> 00:05:25.585
DISTANCING, WEARING MASKS, WHICH

00:05:25.620 --> 00:05:27.969
I HAD ON UNTIL I STOOD HERE IN

00:05:28.003 --> 00:05:29.212
FRONT OF THE CAMERA.

00:05:29.246 --> 00:05:30.997
WE ARE DOING THAT IN THE SENATE.

00:05:31.031 --> 00:05:32.471
WE ARE UP AND RUNNING.

00:05:32.505 --> 00:05:33.695
WE HAVE BEEN IN SESSION THE LAST

00:05:33.729 --> 00:05:34.479
TWO WEEKS.

00:05:34.480 --> 00:05:36.592
I’M NOT SURE WHERE THE HOUSES

00:05:36.594 --> 00:05:38.277
BUT THEY ARE NOT HERE.

00:05:38.312 --> 00:05:40.089
&gt;&gt; Bret: DID YOU GET DIFFERENT

00:05:40.123 --> 00:05:41.836
MEDICAL ADVICE THAN THE HOUSE

00:05:41.871 --> 00:05:42.258
DID?

00:05:42.259 --> 00:05:44.875
&gt;&gt; WE ASKED THE CAPITAL

00:05:44.908 --> 00:05:46.916
PHYSICIAN HOW WE COULD SAFELY

00:05:46.917 --> 00:05:47.294
REENGAGE.

00:05:47.295 --> 00:05:48.974
WE TOOK HIS ADVICE, AND WE ARE

00:05:49.008 --> 00:05:49.913
PRACTICING IT.

00:05:49.947 --> 00:05:51.612
WE ARE FOLLOWING THE ADVICE

00:05:51.646 --> 00:05:52.551
WE’VE BEEN GIVEN.

00:05:52.585 --> 00:05:53.999
&gt;&gt; Bret: HAVE YOU BEEN TESTED?

00:05:54.034 --> 00:05:56.037
&gt;&gt; I VISITED THE WHITE HOUSE

00:05:56.039 --> 00:05:57.458
LAST WEEK AND THE ANSWER TO THAT

00:05:57.492 --> 00:05:58.352
IS YES.

00:05:58.353 --> 00:05:59.537
&gt;&gt; Bret: DR. BRIGHT IS

00:05:59.538 --> 00:06:00.866
TESTIFYING IN THE HOUSE TODAY

00:06:00.867 --> 00:06:02.499
SAYING THE ADMINISTRATION WAS

00:06:02.534 --> 00:06:03.906
WOEFULLY PREPARED, SAYS IT’S

00:06:03.907 --> 00:06:04.689
STILL NOT PREPARED.

00:06:04.723 --> 00:06:06.593
&gt;&gt; PLANS HAVE BEEN IN PLACE AND

00:06:06.627 --> 00:06:07.799
IT’S DISAPPOINTING THAT THEY

00:06:07.834 --> 00:06:09.249
WERE NOT PULLED DOWN IN JANUARY

00:06:09.250 --> 00:06:11.402
OF THIS YEAR AND FOLLOWED.

00:06:11.403 --> 00:06:13.914
THEY WERE NOT PUT ON THE TABLE

00:06:13.915 --> 00:06:15.602
WITH A STRONG LEADER INDICATING

00:06:15.603 --> 00:06:17.443
THESE WERE OUR PLANS, EVERYONE

00:06:17.444 --> 00:06:18.641
FALL IN LINE AND FOLLOW THROUGH

00:06:18.675 --> 00:06:19.479
WITH THE PLAN.

00:06:19.513 --> 00:06:20.736
&gt;&gt; Bret: YOU SAID THAT THE

00:06:20.771 --> 00:06:21.546
PREVIOUS ADMINISTRATION DIDN’T

00:06:21.548 --> 00:06:22.841
LEAVE A PLAN.

00:06:22.875 --> 00:06:24.408
THEY PUSHED BACK AGAINST THAT.

00:06:24.409 --> 00:06:26.207
&gt;&gt; I WAS WRONG.

00:06:26.209 --> 00:06:27.933
THEY DID LEAVE BEHIND A PLAN.

00:06:27.967 --> 00:06:29.202
I CLEARLY MADE A MISTAKE IN THAT

00:06:29.236 --> 00:06:29.611
REGARD.

00:06:29.612 --> 00:06:31.176
AS TO WHETHER OR NOT THE PLAN

00:06:31.211 --> 00:06:32.726
WAS FOLLOWED AND WHO IS THE

00:06:32.760 --> 00:06:34.606
CRITIC AND ALL THE REST, I DON’T

00:06:34.607 --> 00:06:36.447
HAVE ANY OBSERVATION ABOUT THAT

00:06:36.448 --> 00:06:38.878
BECAUSE I DON’T KNOW ENOUGH

00:06:38.879 --> 00:06:42.075
ABOUT THE DETAILS OF IT TO

00:06:42.076 --> 00:06:44.098
COMMENT ON IT IN ANY DETAIL.

00:06:44.099 --> 00:06:45.795
&gt;&gt; Bret: SENATOR BURR PULLED

00:06:45.796 --> 00:06:48.090
HIMSELF OFF THE CHAIRMANSHIP OF

00:06:48.091 --> 00:06:50.392
THE INTELLIGENCE COMMITTEE

00:06:50.426 --> 00:06:50.712
TODAY.

00:06:50.747 --> 00:06:54.296
THERE IS AN INVESTIGATION, FBI

00:06:54.297 --> 00:06:54.604
INVESTIGATION.

00:06:54.638 --> 00:06:56.081
DIANE DIANNE FEINSTEIN BEING

00:06:56.116 --> 00:06:57.753
INVESTIGATED FOR WHAT HER

00:06:57.787 --> 00:06:59.126
HUSBAND DID WITH STOCKS.

00:06:59.161 --> 00:07:01.291
YOUR THOUGHTS ON THAT AND HAVE

00:07:01.325 --> 00:07:02.915
YOU MADE A DECISION ABOUT

00:07:02.949 --> 00:07:03.958
REPLACING SENATOR BURR AS CHAIR

00:07:03.959 --> 00:07:04.696
OF THAT COMMITTEE?

00:07:04.730 --> 00:07:05.839
&gt;&gt; CHAIRMAN BERGER AND I HAD A

00:07:05.874 --> 00:07:06.633
CHANCE TO TALK ABOUT THAT THIS

00:07:06.635 --> 00:07:07.285
MORNING.

00:07:07.286 --> 00:07:10.296
I THINK HE DID THE RIGHT THING.

00:07:10.331 --> 00:07:11.987
FOR THE COMMITTEE AND FOR OUR

00:07:12.022 --> 00:07:13.441
REPUBLICAN CONFERENCE.

00:07:13.442 --> 00:07:15.885
I THANK HIM FOR DOING THAT.

00:07:15.886 --> 00:07:18.754
AT SOME POINT OBVIOUSLY I’LL BE

00:07:18.755 --> 00:07:21.237
NAMING A NEW CHAIR.

00:07:21.239 --> 00:07:22.578
&gt;&gt; Bret: SENATOR RUBIO,

00:07:22.579 --> 00:07:23.780
SENATOR RICH?

00:07:23.781 --> 00:07:26.565
&gt;&gt; I WILL BE NAMING A NEW CHAIR

00:07:26.599 --> 00:07:27.567
SOMETIME SOON.

00:07:27.568 --> 00:07:28.361
&gt;&gt; Bret: OKAY.

00:07:28.395 --> 00:07:30.453
LET ME GET YOUR THOUGHTS ON THE

00:07:30.454 --> 00:07:32.003
MICHAEL FLYNN SITUATION IN THE

00:07:32.004 --> 00:07:33.692
NEWS ABOUT THIS UNMASKING.

00:07:33.693 --> 00:07:37.889
WHAT DO YOU MAKE OF IT AND IS IT

00:07:37.923 --> 00:07:39.837
