00:07:39.872 --> 00:07:42.294
&gt;&gt; IF THERE WERE IN FACT

00:07:42.295 --> 00:07:43.064
MISBEHAVIOR SURROUNDING THE

00:07:43.099 --> 00:07:45.119
FLYNN CASE, THE AMERICAN PUBLIC

00:07:45.120 --> 00:07:47.175
NEEDS TO KNOW.

00:07:47.210 --> 00:07:49.745
CLEARLY THAT WAS THE VIEW OF THE

00:07:49.746 --> 00:07:51.078
ATTORNEY GENERAL.

00:07:51.079 --> 00:07:54.683
I GATHER IT’S NOW IN A RATHER

00:07:54.684 --> 00:07:57.172
UNUSUAL PROCEDURE BEING REVIEWED

00:07:57.207 --> 00:08:00.158
BY THE DISTRICT JUDGE BEFORE

00:08:00.159 --> 00:08:02.182
WHOM THE CASE WAS.

00:08:02.184 --> 00:08:04.229
I THINK WE ARE ANXIOUS TO GET

00:08:04.264 --> 00:08:05.230
THE FACTS.

00:08:05.232 --> 00:08:06.376
WHAT ACTUALLY HAPPENED?

00:08:06.410 --> 00:08:07.993
THE AMERICAN PUBLIC NEEDS TO

00:08:08.028 --> 00:08:09.987
KNOW, ALL OF US WOULD LIKE TO

00:08:09.989 --> 00:08:10.370
KNOW.

00:08:10.372 --> 00:08:12.936
ONE THING ABOUT WASHINGTON, YOU

00:08:12.937 --> 00:08:14.897
GUYS ARE SO GOOD AT YOUR JOB,

00:08:14.931 --> 00:08:16.192
TRUTH ALWAYS COMES OUT.

00:08:16.226 --> 00:08:17.256
SOMETIMES IT TAKES A LITTLE

00:08:17.257 --> 00:08:19.436
LONGER THAN OTHER TIMES.

00:08:19.470 --> 00:08:21.480
WE WILL FIND OUT WHAT IN FACT

00:08:21.481 --> 00:08:22.036
DID HAPPEN.

00:08:22.070 --> 00:08:23.776
&gt;&gt; Bret: I WANT TO ASK YOU

00:08:23.777 --> 00:08:24.576
ABOUT THE ELECTION.

00:08:24.577 --> 00:08:25.849
YOU CALLED IT A CHALLENGING

00:08:25.850 --> 00:08:26.400
ENVIRONMENT.

00:08:26.401 --> 00:08:29.828
ON A SCALE OF 1 TO 10, 10 BEING

00:08:29.862 --> 00:08:31.514
THE MOST CONFIDENT, WHERE DO YOU

00:08:31.548 --> 00:08:33.745
THINK REPUBLICANS ARE AT HOLDING

00:08:33.746 --> 00:08:34.252
THE SENATE?

00:08:34.253 --> 00:08:35.023
TO GO I’M NEVER TOTALLY

00:08:35.058 --> 00:08:36.225
CONFIDENT IN ANY RACE BUT I CAN

00:08:36.259 --> 00:08:37.515
SAY WITH REGARD TO THIS

00:08:37.549 --> 00:08:40.166
QUESTION, I HAVE SAID THE SAME

00:08:40.168 --> 00:08:43.454
THING FROM THE BEGINNING OF THE

00:08:43.488 --> 00:08:44.001
CYCLE.

00:08:44.036 --> 00:08:45.027
WE HAVE 23 MEMBERS.

00:08:45.028 --> 00:08:46.407
A REALLY BIG GLASS AND THE

00:08:46.409 --> 00:08:48.171
REASON WE HAVE A REALLY BIG

00:08:48.172 --> 00:08:49.989
GLASS IS THIS IS THE CLASS THAT

00:08:50.024 --> 00:08:52.589
TOOK OUR MAJORITY BACK IN 2014.

00:08:52.623 --> 00:08:54.178
WE HAVE A LOT OF PEOPLE UP.

00:08:54.179 --> 00:08:55.560
23 UP.

00:08:55.594 --> 00:08:57.059
DEMOCRATS ONLY HAVE 12.

00:08:57.060 --> 00:08:59.079
THIS WAS A CHALLENGING CYCLE

00:08:59.114 --> 00:09:01.141
FROM THE BEGINNING TO THE MIDDLE

00:09:01.142 --> 00:09:01.601
NOW.

00:09:01.635 --> 00:09:03.088
I THINK THE MAJORITY IN THE

00:09:03.089 --> 00:09:05.276
SENATE IS VERY MUCH IN QUESTION,

00:09:05.278 --> 00:09:07.116
AS IT HAS BEEN FOR A YEAR AND A

00:09:07.117 --> 00:09:07.561
HALF.

00:09:07.562 --> 00:09:09.764
&gt;&gt; Bret: ARE YOU TRYING TO GET

00:09:09.798 --> 00:09:10.900
SECRETARY OF STATE POMPEO TO RUN

00:09:10.934 --> 00:09:11.669
IN KANSAS?

00:09:11.704 --> 00:09:13.443
&gt;&gt; THAT HAS BEEN MY HELP.

00:09:13.444 --> 00:09:14.791
YOU CAN SEE HOW WELL I HAVE DONE

00:09:14.825 --> 00:09:15.226
SO FAR.

00:09:15.227 --> 00:09:15.827
[LAUGHS]

00:09:15.828 --> 00:09:17.582
&gt;&gt; Bret: ARE YOU STILL HOPEFUL

00:09:17.617 --> 00:09:19.155
ON THAT FRONT?

00:09:19.189 --> 00:09:21.313
&gt;&gt; THE FILING DEADLINE IS

00:09:21.314 --> 00:09:22.978
JUNE 1, SO THIS IS BEN’S WON’T

00:09:22.979 --> 00:09:24.190
LAST MUCH LONGER.

00:09:24.192 --> 00:09:27.427
&gt;&gt; Bret: WHAT DO YOU TELL

00:09:27.428 --> 00:09:29.035
VULNERABLE REPUBLICANS IN TOUGH

00:09:29.069 --> 00:09:29.304
RACES?

00:09:29.338 --> 00:09:32.732
WHETHER THEY SHOULD BE EMBRACING

00:09:32.766 --> 00:09:34.361
THE PRESIDENT FULLY OR PROVIDING

00:09:34.396 --> 00:09:35.300
SOME DISTANCE FROM THE

00:09:35.301 --> 00:09:35.637
PRESIDENT.

00:09:35.638 --> 00:09:38.421
DO YOU THINK HE WILL BE A

00:09:38.423 --> 00:09:39.728
REFERENDUM ABOUT HOW THIS

00:09:39.729 --> 00:09:41.051
ADMINISTRATION HANDLES THE

00:09:41.052 --> 00:09:42.690
HEALTH CRISIS AND THE ECONOMIC

00:09:42.692 --> 00:09:42.914
CRISIS?

00:09:42.948 --> 00:09:44.194
&gt;&gt; LOOK, EVERY STATE IS

00:09:44.228 --> 00:09:46.426
DIFFERENT AND FAR BE IT FOR ME

00:09:46.427 --> 00:09:48.701
TO GIVE ADVICE TO A CANDIDATE IN

00:09:48.736 --> 00:09:49.554
MONTANA VERSUS COLORADO VERSUS

00:09:49.555 --> 00:09:49.998
MAINE.

00:09:50.033 --> 00:09:51.977
I THINK EACH OF OUR CANDIDATES

00:09:51.979 --> 00:09:53.555
ARE VERY SHARP.

00:09:53.590 --> 00:09:56.388
THEY GOT ELECTED SIX YEARS AGO.

00:09:56.390 --> 00:09:58.104
THEY KNOW THEIR STATE’S BEST,

00:09:58.138 --> 00:09:59.868
AND I DON’T HAVE ANY KIND OF

00:09:59.869 --> 00:10:00.914
UNIVERSAL RECOMMENDATION ABOUT

00:10:00.949 --> 00:10:02.940
HOW TO RUN IN A GIVEN STATE.

00:10:02.975 --> 00:10:04.776
&gt;&gt; Bret: DO YOU THINK THERE

00:10:04.777 --> 00:10:05.977
WILL BE AN IN PERSON REPUBLICAN

00:10:05.979 --> 00:10:06.550
CONVENTION?

00:10:06.551 --> 00:10:08.715
&gt;&gt; I HAVE NO IDEA.

00:10:08.716 --> 00:10:10.019
THAT’S A VERY INTERESTING

00:10:10.020 --> 00:10:10.710
QUESTION.

00:10:10.711 --> 00:10:13.411
I THINK THAT IS THE CURRENT

00:10:13.412 --> 00:10:17.665
GAME PLAN, BUT I THINK WE HAVE

00:10:17.666 --> 00:10:19.634
TO SEE WHAT THE STATUS OF THE

00:10:19.668 --> 00:10:22.680
PANDEMIC IS IN LATE SUMMER AND

00:10:22.681 --> 00:10:24.175
MAKE THE CALL THEN.

00:10:24.177 --> 00:10:25.446
&gt;&gt; Bret: WHAT IS YOUR BIGGEST

00:10:25.481 --> 00:10:26.748
WORRY RIGHT NOW?

00:10:26.783 --> 00:10:29.742
&gt;&gt; RIGHT NOW?

00:10:29.776 --> 00:10:34.283
GETTING THE ECONOMY OPEN,

00:10:34.285 --> 00:10:36.330
GETTING THIS CORONAVIRUS

00:10:36.332 --> 00:10:39.767
BEGINNING TO RECEDE IN ALL PARTS

00:10:39.802 --> 00:10:42.564
OF THE COUNTRY, AND HELPING

00:10:42.598 --> 00:10:43.865
AMERICANS STAGE A COMEBACK.

00:10:43.867 --> 00:10:46.435
WE HAD A FABULOUS ECONOMY AS

00:10:46.436 --> 00:10:48.215
LATE AS FEBRUARY OF THIS YEAR,

00:10:48.249 --> 00:10:50.598
AND WE LIKE FOR THE AMERICAN

00:10:50.633 --> 00:10:52.605
PEOPLE TO BEGIN TO BENEFIT FROM

00:10:52.607 --> 00:10:54.517
A COMEBACK AS SOON AS POSSIBLE.

00:10:54.551 --> 00:10:56.317
LOOK, WE CAN’T BORROW ENOUGH

00:10:56.351 --> 00:10:57.991
MONEY TO PROP THIS ECONOMY UP

00:10:58.025 --> 00:10:58.600
INDEFINITELY.

00:10:58.601 --> 00:11:00.875
WE HAVE TO BEGIN TO ENGAGE THE

00:11:00.909 --> 00:11:01.961
ECONOMY AGAIN.

00:11:01.962 --> 00:11:05.091
I AM CONVINCED THAT WE CAN DO

00:11:05.092 --> 00:11:06.209
THAT SAFELY.

00:11:06.210 --> 00:11:08.160
&gt;&gt; Bret: THE PRESIDENT TWEETED

00:11:08.162 --> 00:11:09.298
OUT THAT HE THINKS

00:11:09.299 --> 00:11:11.325
PRESIDENT OBAMA SHOULD BE CALLED

00:11:11.327 --> 00:11:13.519
UP TO A HEARING IN THE SENATE.

00:11:13.521 --> 00:11:14.965
HE CALLS IT OBAMAGATE.

00:11:14.966 --> 00:11:16.653
&gt;&gt; OBAMAGATE, IT’S BEEN GOING ON

00:11:16.654 --> 00:11:18.066
FOR A LONG TIME.

00:11:18.101 --> 00:11:20.080
GOING ON FROM BEFORE I GOT

00:11:20.115 --> 00:11:21.831
ELECTED AND IT’S A DISGRACE.

00:11:21.865 --> 00:11:23.529
&gt;&gt; Bret: DO YOU CALL IT THAT

00:11:23.530 --> 00:11:25.244
WHAT DO YOU THINK ABOUT THAT

00:11:25.245 --> 00:11:26.743
CALL TO HAVE THEM TESTIFY?

00:11:26.778 --> 00:11:28.312
&gt;&gt; IT WILL BE UP TO CHAIRMAN

00:11:28.314 --> 00:11:30.212
GRAHAM TO MAKE THOSE DECISIONS.

00:11:30.246 --> 00:11:31.786
I THINK HE MAY HAVE ADDRESSED IT

00:11:31.820 --> 00:11:32.217
ALREADY.

00:11:32.252 --> 00:11:33.163
I’M NOT CERTAIN.

00:11:33.164 --> 00:11:34.690
&gt;&gt; Bret: HE SAID HE WOULD BE

00:11:34.724 --> 00:11:36.297
UNCOMFORTABLE WITH IT AND IT

00:11:36.298 --> 00:11:37.795
LIKELY WOULDN’T HAPPEN.

00:11:37.830 --> 00:11:39.304
WHERE DO YOU THINK THIS

00:11:39.338 --> 00:11:40.098
INVESTIGATION GOES?

00:11:40.100 --> 00:11:41.611
&gt;&gt; LOOK, THAT’S UP TO CHAIRMAN

00:11:41.612 --> 00:11:42.804
GRAHAM TO DETERMINE HOW TO

00:11:42.805 --> 00:11:43.218
HANDLE IT.

00:11:43.219 --> 00:11:44.780
I HAVE A LOT OF CONFIDENCE IN

00:11:44.814 --> 00:11:48.142
HIM AND HE KNOWS WHAT HE’S DOING

00:11:48.143 --> 00:11:49.748
AND I’M GOING TO FOLLOW HIS

00:11:49.750 --> 00:11:50.159
