00:12:18.860 --> 00:12:20.038
SO CONSISTENT WITH MY

00:12:20.039 --> 00:12:21.080
RESPONSIBILITIES AS MAJORITY

00:12:21.115 --> 00:12:23.272
LEADER, I TRY TO DO THE BEST I

00:12:23.307 --> 00:12:24.679
CAN FOR KENTUCKY.

00:12:24.713 --> 00:12:26.505
I THINK IT’S BEEN A REAL BENEFIT

00:12:26.539 --> 00:12:28.692
TO OUR STATE TO HAVE THE

00:12:28.693 --> 00:12:29.823
MAJORITY LEADER OF THE SENATE

